{"text":"Fifth grade was Queen Esther. Now to play a historical biblical character, this beautiful queen who saved her people, had God's favor on her. I got the narrator. I was at the beginning, the end, and in the middle to say, what happens next? Well, what happened next was this pattern all throughout high school, but I still had this desire in my heart. So much so, even though the odds were against me, but I didn't have the guts to approach my parents and tell them I wanted to study acting for college. I mean, it didn't even make sense based on my reality. So I went to a liberal arts school called Hood College, and I studied broadcast, journalism, and French. There was no theater there, but I still had this desire in my heart. So I was like, I'm going to take it upon myself to learn as much as I can. I'm in the States, and I have all these resources where I can watch films that I had heard about that are now at the library. I went to community theater and watched those plays. I read books. I read plays. There was a Shakespeare company down the street. I went there, volunteered, and they gave me my first professional role. Now my character came at the end of the play, but I had a whole monologue as the courtesan in Comedy of Errors.","words":[{"text":"Fifth","start":0.84,"end":1.4},{"text":"grade","start":1.4,"end":1.86},{"text":"was","start":1.86,"end":2.22},{"text":"Queen","start":2.22,"end":2.5},{"text":"Esther","start":2.5,"end":2.94,"punct":"."},{"text":"Now","start":3.5,"end":3.52},{"text":"to","start":3.52,"end":3.72},{"text":"play","start":3.72,"end":4.14},{"text":"a","start":4.14,"end":4.48},{"text":"historical","start":4.48,"end":5.22},{"text":"biblical","start":5.22,"end":6.06},{"text":"character","start":6.06,"end":6.74,"punct":","},{"text":"this","start":6.9,"end":7.0},{"text":"beautiful","start":7.0,"end":7.4},{"text":"queen","start":7.4,"end":7.86},{"text":"who","start":7.86,"end":8.08},{"text":"saved","start":8.08,"end":8.4},{"text":"her","start":